# it tapped through Bot2's untap (CR 122.1d). Bot1's Cryptic Command then taps the other two Elves, a second batch the same turn
# that draws nothing (603.2h), leaving Bot1 two cards (Cryptic Command's own draw and Sharae's). Turn 5: a second Cryptic Command
# taps the Elves again, a new turn, so Sharae draws again.

